{"type":"seed","doc_id":"d2_doc0118","fact_refs":[7],"question":"Which three classifiers achieved around 80% accuracy in this study, and what was the test dataset size?","answer":"Naive Bayes, RBF-kernel Support Vector Machine, and Logistic Regression achieved around 80% accuracy, tested on a dataset of 5000 tweets."}
