{"type":"seed","doc_id":"d2_doc0118","fact_refs":[4,5],"question":"How does the proposed model's accuracy and training speed compare to the baseline model?","answer":"The proposed model's accuracy is 2-3% higher than the baseline model, and it trains at twice the speed of the baseline model."}
